      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow3:064",
        "answer": "Constructs CoD.AmmoWidgetWZ_WeaponImage from the displayed menu/controller/layout arguments. Creates PowerWeaponDrainGadget3 as CoD.AmmoWidget_PowerWeaponDrain.new, PowerWeaponDrainGadget2 as CoD.AmmoWidget_PowerWeaponDrain.new, WeaponImage as LUI.UIFixedAspectRatioImage.new, HeroAbilityUseString as CoD.AmmoWidgetWZ_WeaponName.new. Connects 4 model/path references; the model subscription effects below specify which receiver changes and under which nil/value guard. Installs 1 event/action/override bindings; each callback keeps its captured controller/menu/widget references and executes only on its bound delivery. The ordered effect contract retains every property, model, visual, navigation, callback and return mutation in source order; returning self is not proof the original game loads this widget.",
